      "maximum": 32,
      "minimum": 1,
      "type": "integer",
    },
    "settings": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Optional settings. They layer as preset -> quick -> advanced: a preset is a named quick-settings combination, quick is seven knobs that cover most work, and advanced exposes each pipeline option on its own; later layers win, and every 'auto' value is resolved by the engine. Call list_options for the full vocabulary.",
